			"label": "1 · Room in 3D · MVP"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 460,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 1226,
			"label": "2 · Furniture from any image · MVP"
		},
		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 760,
			"y": -560,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 360,
			"label": "Legend"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Else build it: image → 3D**\nMeshy / Hunyuan3D / Blender MCP `generate_3d`. Async, 1–3 min.\nThird-party \"openai gpt-6-astra image-to-3d\" on WaveSpeed: unverified.",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 476,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Normalise**\nScale to real dims, base on floor, front faces +Z, decimate, GLB. Repaint to the palette (`restyle()`).",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 666,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Risk: no confirmed OpenAI image-to-3D**\nCheck the hackathon rules. Demo: pre-generate the hero sofa, live-generate one more on stage.",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 830,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Phone-first web app, three.js**\nReuse Misplaced `real.js` (renderer, sun, shadows, AO), `labels.js`, `rotate.js`.",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Inputs**\nCamera · upload · PWA share target, so a screenshot from Instagram / Pinterest goes straight in.",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 208,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Small backend**\nHolds the OpenAI key, runs 3D jobs, caches models. Node on Vercel.",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 372,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Screens**\nMy room · Add piece (spinner while 3D builds) · Verdict + advice list · Talk",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 920,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 658,
			"label": "3 · App / website · MVP"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Free-floor map**\nFrom the room graph: walls, door swings, windows, radiators, existing pieces.",
			"x": 1390,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Candidates**\nSlide the piece along every wall segment and the room centre; score each spot: walkway ≥ 30 in, door swing clear, not in front of radiator / window.",
			"x": 1390,
			"y": 208,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Pick + say it**\nCode keeps only legal spots; Decisions picks the best one (\"best wall: one of […]\") with a probability.\nVerdict: Fits / Just fits / Doesn't fit.",
			"x": 1390,
			"y": 398,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Rule: geometry comes from code, never the model**\nThe model reads pictures and explains; solvers measure.",
			"x": 1390,
			"y": 588,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1380,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 762,
			"label": "4 · Where to put it · MVP"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**5a · Model check: rules, pass / fail**\nNothing overlaps or pokes through walls · everything on the floor · no rough edges / broken meshes · doors open fully · a path from every door to every room, bed side and window (grid A*) · walkways ≥ 30 in.",
			"x": 1850,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 196,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**5b · Design grade** (Decisions API)\nLight: daylight reach, lamps per zone, dark corners · Flow: paths, pinch points · Proportion: rug vs sofa, TV height, curtain length (Misplaced solvers) · Fit together: style / colour score across pieces.",
			"x": 1850,
			"y": 286,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 196,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Split: 5a in code (exact, instant), 5b in Decisions**\nCode computes the numbers; Decisions answers the batch of yes/no + scores with probabilities → ranked advice.",
			"x": 1850,
			"y": 502,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Show it**\nEach finding = marker in 3D (red `.mk` problem, green `.gr` fix) + one plain sentence + \"Show me\".",
			"x": 1850,
			"y": 692,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5_4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Scope for demo: 6–8 checks**\nPath blocked · walkway too tight · door hits furniture · rug floats · dark corner · new piece clashes with the room.",
			"x": 1850,
			"y": 856,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 144,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1840,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 1030,
			"label": "5 · Analyse the room · MVP (scope it)"
		},
		{
			"id": "p6_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Realtime voice**\n\"Does it fit by the window?\" · \"Try the other wall\" · \"What's wrong with this room?\"",
			"x": 2310,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p6_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Tool calls**\n`place_item` · `move_item` · `analyse_room` · `render`\nDecisions routes each sentence: move / swap / ask / render.",
			"x": 2310,
			"y": 208,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p6",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 408,
			"color": "6",
			"label": "6 · Voice: talk to your room · Stretch"
		},
		{
			"id": "p7_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**gpt-image edit**\nScreenshot of the 3D view + room photo → \"your room with this sofa, Sunday morning\".",
			"x": 2770,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p7_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Backup: Blender Cycles**\n`hoskins_street_2026-09-26_photoreal.blend` already exists.",
			"x": 2770,
			"y": 208,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 118,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p7",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2760,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 356,
			"color": "6",
			"label": "7 · Photoreal render · Stretch"
		},
		{
			"id": "root",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Pocket Room\nYour flat in 3D. Any sofa you see (shop photo, screenshot) is built in 3D, dropped in, checked, and you can talk to your room about it.\nOpenAI: Vision · Decisions · Realtime voice · gpt-image\nFlow: 1 room + 2 piece → 4 place → 5 check → 6 talk / 7 render; 3 wraps it all",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "l0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "🟩 exists / works",
