			"text": "🟪 stretch (if time)",
			"x": 780,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 44,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "demo",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Demo, 90 s\n1. Hackathon room appears in 3D from one photo (or the prebuilt flat)\n2. \"Analyse my room\" → 3 markers: path blocked, walkway tight, dark corner\n3. Share a sofa screenshot → built in 3D, lands to scale\n4. Verdict: \"Just fits. Long wall.\" It slides there\n5. (stretch) say it by voice · (stretch) photoreal Sunday-morning render",
			"x": 1240,
			"y": -560,
			"width": 620,
			"height": 360,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "qs",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Open questions\n- Hackathon date, team size, rules on non-OpenAI models (image → 3D)?\n- Decisions API access: public beta since 6 Oct per press; check the real docs\n- Do we get to photograph / measure the venue beforehand?\n- Name: Pocket Room is a placeholder",
			"x": 1920,
			"y": -560,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 360,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**My flat is already built** (26 Sep)\nHoskins Street, plan-accurate to ~1%\n`~/Documents/Work/AIInteriorDesigner/hoskins-street-flat/from_scratch_2026-09-26/viewer/model.glb` (3.4 MB) + `manifest.json` (room boxes)\nIFC with real walls & openings · drag-to-rearrange viewer",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 248,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/hoskins_day_overview.jpg",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 338,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 214
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Export to the app format**\nGLB + room graph JSON: walls, openings, door swings, radiators, existing furniture footprints, free floor.\nPlacement (4) and checks (5) read this, not the mesh.",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 588,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 196,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Live hackathon room: rough box in ~1 min** ✅ possible\nPhoto / 10 s video → Vision → room W×L×H, doors, windows, big objects as boxes → `shell.js` (Misplaced) → 3D.\nRectangular, ±10–20 cm. Good enough to wow, not to measure.",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 804,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 222,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Fun shortcut: photograph the fire-escape plan on the wall**\n`floorplan recognition pipeline`: plan image → graph.json in one VLM call, the rest local in seconds.",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 1046,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1_5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Risk: the full floorplan-to-3d skill takes hours** (overlay checks), not live.\nBackup: pace / laser the hall the day before and prebuild; the live run only has to match it.",
			"x": 10,
			"y": 1236,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Read the picture** (Vision)\nShop photo, tag or screenshot → category, style, colour, material, dimensions.\nNo size on it → category defaults (sofa 84 in, etc.), flagged as estimated.",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 70,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Match from DB first**\nCatalogue of ready GLBs: `hoskins…/models` (plants, lamp, pillows), Misplaced `kit-real.js` parametric pieces (sofa, bed, rug, desk sized to any dims), Poly Haven.\nPick by embeddings + Decisions choice.",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 196,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2_agent",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**4th source: the agent finds it for you**\n\"Find me a sofa for this wall\" → web search in shops → only pieces that fit the free spot and match the room's style → image + dims → same path as a photo.",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 994,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 222,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_group",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Development plan · what runs in parallel, what waits",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1636,
			"width": 2400,
			"height": 1560
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_h0",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "## Phase 0 · together",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_h1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "## Phase 1 · parallel lanes",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_h2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "## Phase 2 · integration (dependent)",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_h3",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "## Phase 3 · stretch",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_h4",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1960,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "## Phase 4 · demo",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_p0",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 1786,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 352,
			"text": "**Contract first, ~2 h, blocks everything**\n- `room.json`: walls, openings, door swings, radiators, furniture footprints, free floor (metres)\n- `piece.json`: category, dims, style tags, glb url, source\n- API: `/piece` (image → piece) · `/place` · `/analyse`\n- Fixtures by hand: Hoskins living room + 1 sofa\n- Repo skeleton: `app/`, `server/`, `rules/`, `room/`, `furniture/`",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_A",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 1786,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 196,
			"text": "**A · Room** (part 1)\nHoskins → GLB + room.json · live box room from a photo · fire-plan shortcut\n**Build the hackathon room:** on arrival measure + photograph the venue → room.json + GLB; then try the live photo build against it",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_B",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2002,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "**B · Furniture** (part 2)\nVision read · DB match · image → 3D · normalise.\n⚠ Test the 3D vendor on day 1: slowest, riskiest lane",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_C",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2192,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "**C · App** (part 3)\nViewer loads GLB + room.json · camera / upload / share target · backend with the key · deploy",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_D",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2356,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 118,
			"text": "**D · Rules in code** (parts 4 + 5a)\nPlacement candidates + legal spots · model check: overlaps, doors, paths (A*), walkways",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_E",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2494,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "**E · Decisions** (parts 4 + 5b)\nVerdict + best wall · design-grade question set (light, flow, proportion, style) · tuned on fixtures",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_G",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2658,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "**G · Agent finds furniture** (part 2)\nAgent searches shops for pieces that fit the free spot and the room's style → product image + dims → piece.json, same path as B",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_F",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2822,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "**F · Render** (part 7, stretch)\ngpt-image edit from a screenshot + room photo. Needs nothing else: anyone free can start it",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_note",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": 2996,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "Each lane needs only the contract + fixtures, so all run at once.\n6 people: one lane each · 3 people: A+C · B+G · D+E"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_I1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 1786,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 118,
			"text": "**Add-a-piece loop** ★ the product\nimage → piece → placed in the room → verdict\nneeds A · B · C · D (+ E for the verdict)",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_I2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 1944,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 118,
			"text": "**Analysis view**\nmarkers + advice list in 3D\nneeds C · D · E (A for the real room)",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_T",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 2102,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 248,
			"text": "**Test every source in both rooms**\nRooms: Hoskins flat · hackathon room\nSources: live photo in the venue · shop photo / tag · screenshot from a feed · agent-suggested from the internet\nEach: 3D built? true size? placed sensibly? verdict right?\nneeds the loop",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_V",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": 1786,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 144,
			"text": "**Voice** (part 6)\nRealtime tools call the same `/place` `/analyse`\nneeds the loop working",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_R",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": 1970,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 118,
			"text": "**Render in the app**\nwire lane F into the viewer\nneeds C",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_demo",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1960,
			"y": 1786,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "**Demo**\nShow all four sources in the hackathon room · pre-generate hero pieces · prebuild / measure the venue room · rehearse the 90 s · record a fallback video",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dev_crit",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1960,
			"y": 1996,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "**Critical path**\ncontract → C viewer + A export → D placement → add-a-piece loop → demo.\nB runs beside it; if image → 3D fails, DB match carries the demo",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_group",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Progress with screenshots",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 3396,
			"width": 1820,
