		},
		{
			"id": "prog_head",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 3456,
			"width": 1400,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Progress · 1 Nov, 14:00 · test pass done\n🟩 tested, works on its own · 🟧 partly · nothing merged into main yet. Joining them needs the must-fixes below."
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_B",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 3596,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 274,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**B · Furniture: image → 3D works through OpenAI** 🟩 tested\n`gpt-6-astra` reads the photo and returns 3D parts; our code builds the GLB. 15–35 s, clean low-poly, right shape and colours, untextured.\nAll 3 test pictures pass (photo, shop tag, Instagram screenshot).\nBranch `claude/lane-b-furniture-fc4f26`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_B_img0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneB_chesterfield_3d.jpg",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 3596,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_B_img1",
