			"x": 790,
			"y": 3596,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_C",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 3936,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 222,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "**C · App: phone viewer runs end to end on the stubs** 🟧 partly\nRoom in 3D with sun and shadows, Add piece flow, verdict markers, PWA share target.\nVercel preview not deployed (needs your OK to create a project).\nBranch `claude/lane-c-app-9d1714`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_C_img0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneC_my_room.jpg",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 3936,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_C_img1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneC_verdict.jpg",
			"x": 790,
			"y": 3936,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_E",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 4276,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 196,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**E · Decisions API works with our key** 🟩 tested\n`gpt-6-luna`, no fallback needed. Best spot with a reason, 6 design findings on the fixture room, voice routing.\n12 tests + live smoke pass.\nBranch `claude/lane-e-decisions-790a42`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_F",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 4512,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**F · Render: 3D view → photo in ~15 s** 🟩 tested\n`gpt-image-2.5-flare` won on quality and speed. 5 tests pass.\nNeeds `OPENAI_MODEL_RENDER` in `.env`.\nBranch `lane-f-render`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_F_img0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneF_input_view.jpg",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 4512,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_F_img1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneF_living_sunday.jpg",
			"x": 910,
			"y": 4512,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_F_img2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/laneF_chesterfield_sunday.jpg",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 4512,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_G",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 4852,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**G · Agent finds 3 real UK products that fit** 🟩 tested\nLinks checked (200), sizes copied from the product pages. 15 tests pass.\nBranch `claude/lane-g-agent-985b31`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_A",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 5062,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 326,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**A · Room: your flat exact, venue room from one photo** 🟩 tested\nAll 5 rooms of the flat exported from the 26 Sep build (±4 cm); replaces the fixture.\nVenue from one photo: a 9–11 × 6 × 4.1 m box with windows, Chesterfields and a column in 14–17 s, but ±3 m because one photo shows one wall: take 3–4 corner photos or measure two walls.\nFire-plan shortcut works. 24 tests pass.\nBranch `lane-a-room`"
		},
		{
			"id": "prog_D",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 5428,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 248,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "**D · Rules: placement and model check in code** 🟩 tested\nFree-floor grid (4 cm), walkways, legal spots best first, model findings with markers. place ≈ 0.1 s, analyse ≈ 1 s.\n8 tests: tiny, typical, crowded rooms + the fixture sofa.\nBranch `lane-d-rules`"
		},
		{
			"id": "test_must",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 5796,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 586,
			"color": "1",
			"text": "## Test pass: must-fix before the demo\n1. **D ↔ E hook missing:** `decisions/hooks.mjs` doesn't exist, so the Decisions API is never called through `/api/place` and `/api/analyse`. A 10-line adapter fixes it (tested).\n2. **C keeps the old sofa** when the new one replaces it → \"overlap by 94 cm\" (see screenshot).\n3. **C sends only `roomId`; D and G always use the fixture room** → look rooms up from lane A.\n4. **C's Sample button 404s** (B doesn't serve the fixture id).\n5. **Deploy:** Vercel config misses `room/**`; B writes files and runs 3D jobs in-process, which serverless loses → host the server long-running or add a store.\nShould-fix: fern 14 cm into the wall (A) · hall path \"blocked\" at the partition nib (D) · E's own flow grid disagrees with D · G should use D's `place()` · \"0% sure\" text in C · E/G tests expect the old fixture.\nDemo note: a 0.78 m armchair doesn't fit anywhere in Kate's room; only a sofa replacing the old one fits → demo with a sofa.\nMerge order: A → D → E + hook → B → G → F → C."
		},
		{
			"id": "test_img",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "attachments/test_joined_verdict.jpg",
			"x": 640,
			"y": 5796,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 715
		},
		{
			"id": "test_cap",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 5796,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "**All lanes joined behind lane C's app, with lane A's real room**\nReal placement (\"Just fits, west wall\") and 11 findings as markers. Shows bug 2: the old sofa stays."
		}
	],
